@API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7096

### 1. Get a token (copy "accessToken" from the response into @token below)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ajay",
  "password": "any"
}

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### 2. Get all students
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Student
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get one student
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create a student
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Student
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ravi Kumar",
  "dob": "2002-05-14",
  "mobileNo": "9876543210",
  "createdBy": 1
}

### 5. Update a student
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Ravi K",
  "dob": "2002-05-14",
  "mobileNo": "9876543210",
  "modifiedBy": 1
}

### 6. Delete a student
DELETE {{API_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1?modifiedBy=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
